---
import SiteLayout from "../../../components/layout/SiteLayout.astro";

const pageTitle = "A very serious guide to choosing your first Pokémon — Vivek Raman";
const description =
  "Temporary Pokémon field notes with starter advice, route tips, and questionable data.";
const canonical = new URL("blog/pokemon/", Astro.site ?? "https://vivekraman.dev");
---

<SiteLayout
  pageTitle={pageTitle}
  description={description}
  includeOpenGraph={false}
  canonicalUrl={canonical.href}
  wrapperClass="post-layout"
  breadcrumbs={[{ href: "/blog/", label: "Blog" }, { label: "Pokémon" }]}
>
  <article class="pokemon-blog prose prose-article" aria-labelledby="pokemon-blog-title">
    <header class="pokemon-blog__header">
      <p class="post-header__meta">Field notes · September 12, 2026</p>
      <h1 id="pokemon-blog-title" class="post-header__title">
        A very serious guide to choosing your first Pokémon
      </h1>
      <p class="pokemon-blog__dek">
        A pocket-sized tour through routes, rival battles, and the small decisions that somehow become
        a whole afternoon.
      </p>
      <div class="pokemon-blog__badge" aria-label="Placeholder article">Placeholder field guide</div>
    </header>

    <div class="pokemon-blog__body">
      <p>
        Every journey starts with the same question: do you want a warm lizard, a determined turtle,
        or a seed-carrying frog with excellent posture? The right answer depends on your route, your
        snacks, and how much patience you have for status effects.
      </p>

      <p>
        This is a temporary collection of made-up notes for the Pokémon blog. The numbers are
        suspicious, the rankings are personal, and the berry pie recipe still needs work.
      </p>

      <section aria-labelledby="starter-heading">
        <h2 id="starter-heading">The starter decision</h2>
        <div class="pokemon-blog__starter-grid">
          <div class="pokemon-blog__starter-card">
            <span class="pokemon-blog__type pokemon-blog__type--fire">Fire</span>
            <h3>Emberling</h3>
            <p>Small, warm, and likely to singe your backpack.</p>
            <span class="pokemon-blog__stat">Best for: dramatic entrances</span>
          </div>
          <div class="pokemon-blog__starter-card">
            <span class="pokemon-blog__type pokemon-blog__type--water">Water</span>
            <h3>Shellbit</h3>
            <p>Reliable in the rain and surprisingly good at finding shortcuts.</p>
            <span class="pokemon-blog__stat">Best for: patient explorers</span>
          </div>
          <div class="pokemon-blog__starter-card">
            <span class="pokemon-blog__type pokemon-blog__type--grass">Grass</span>
            <h3>Spriglet</h3>
            <p>Quietly confident, with a leaf that doubles as a tiny umbrella.</p>
            <span class="pokemon-blog__stat">Best for: long routes</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section aria-labelledby="route-heading">
        <h2 id="route-heading">A route worth wandering</h2>
        <p>
          Route 14 begins behind a bakery and ends somewhere near a lighthouse. Nobody agrees on the
          exact distance. The useful landmarks are easier to remember:
        </p>
        <ol>
          <li>Turn left when the windmill starts making a noise like a tired violin.</li>
          <li>Rest beside the blue sign. The sign is not blue, but the bench is.</li>
          <li>Save one Potion for the bridge and one snack for yourself.</li>
        </ol>
      </section>

      <aside class="pokemon-blog__callout">
        <strong>Field note 07</strong>
        <p>
          If your rival says they have a strategy, they probably have a Pidgey and a lot of
          confidence.
        </p>
      </aside>

      <section aria-labelledby="packing-heading">
        <h2 id="packing-heading">The essential pack</h2>
        <table>
          <thead>
            <tr><th scope="col">Item</th><th scope="col">Quantity</th><th scope="col">Reason</th></tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr><td>Potion</td><td>4</td><td>For surprise grass</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Repel</td><td>2</td><td>For focused walking</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Berry bun</td><td>1</td><td>For morale</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </section>

      <p class="pokemon-blog__signoff">More completely unverified field notes soon.</p>
    </div>
  </article>

  <style>
    .pokemon-blog {
      max-width: min(var(--content-reading), 100%);
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: var(--gap-below-topbar) var(--page-pad) 4rem;
    }

    .pokemon-blog__header {
      padding: 0.5rem 0 1.75rem;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-stroke);
    }

    .pokemon-blog__dek {
      max-width: 48ch;
      margin: 1rem 0 0;
      color: var(--color-muted);
      font-size: 1.08rem;
      line-height: 1.55;
    }

    .pokemon-blog__badge {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 1.25rem;
      padding: 0.35rem 0.6rem;
      border: 1px solid var(--color-stroke);
      border-radius: var(--radius-control);
      color: var(--color-muted-2);
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.65rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .pokemon-blog__body {
      padding-top: 2.25rem;
    }

    .pokemon-blog__starter-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 0.85rem;
      margin: 1.25rem 0 2.5rem;
    }

    .pokemon-blog__starter-card {
      min-width: 0;
      padding: 1rem;
      border: 1px solid var(--color-stroke);
      border-radius: var(--radius-tight);
      background: var(--color-surface-2);
    }

    .pokemon-blog__starter-card h3 {
      margin: 0.75rem 0 0.35rem;
    }

    .pokemon-blog__starter-card p {
      margin: 0 0 1rem;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }

    .pokemon-blog__type,
    .pokemon-blog__stat {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.65rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.07em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .pokemon-blog__type {
      color: var(--color-muted-2);
    }
    .pokemon-blog__type--fire {
      color: #c15b42;
    }
    .pokemon-blog__type--water {
      color: #3b7ca8;
    }
    .pokemon-blog__type--grass {
      color: #5f8b5b;
    }
    .pokemon-blog__stat {
      color: var(--color-muted-2);
    }

    .pokemon-blog__callout {
      margin: 2rem 0;
      padding: 1rem 1.1rem;
      border-left: 3px solid var(--color-accent);
      background: var(--color-surface-2);
    }

    .pokemon-blog__callout strong {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.68rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .pokemon-blog__callout p {
      margin: 0.45rem 0 0;
    }
    .pokemon-blog__signoff {
      color: var(--color-muted);
      font-style: italic;
    }

    @media (max-width: 680px) {
      .pokemon-blog__starter-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
    }
  </style>
</SiteLayout>
